      "duration": 2.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "市場已經有了新一股的共識",
      "start": 64.9,
      "duration": 1.9,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這股共識",
      "start": 66.8,
      "duration": 0.84,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那就是TACO交易的行程",
