      "duration": 2.18,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這項政策本身是利多還是利空",
      "start": 84.46,
      "duration": 2.66,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "而是市場相信TACO交易的人多不多",
      "start": 87.12,
      "duration": 3.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "也就是預判別人的預判",
