      "duration": 1.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "只要大家相信",
      "start": 91.86,
      "duration": 1.1,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這件事情沒有比4月份來得嚴重",
      "start": 92.96,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那大家就不會選擇這段時間",
      "start": 94.96,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "選擇大幅度的出清股票",
      "start": 96.96,
      "duration": 1.64,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "反而有開始陸續佈局的條件存在",
      "start": 98.6,
      "duration": 2.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "所以在這樣的一個效果底下",
      "start": 101.14,
      "duration": 1.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "今年整體AI股表現仍然非常亮麗",
      "start": 102.44,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "不過從總體績效來進行回測",
      "start": 105.2,
      "duration": 2.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "今年其實表現最為亮麗的資產",
      "start": 107.74,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "仍然屬於黃金",
      "start": 110.04,
      "duration": 1.24,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那麼在整個25年到26年",
      "start": 111.28,
      "duration": 2.1,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "到底是AI還是黃金",
      "start": 113.38,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "才是市場上最為亮麗的績效表現呢",
      "start": 115.32,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "與此同時是否搭配著AI的風險資產",
      "start": 118.32,
      "duration": 3.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "搭配著黃金的避險資產",
      "start": 121.86,
      "duration": 1.76,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "反而成為了25年到26年的最強組合",
      "start": 123.62,
      "duration": 3.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "給投資朋友做些思維",
      "start": 126.76,
      "duration": 1.5,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "首先我們看一下數據",
      "start": 128.26,
      "duration": 1.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "其實從今年黃金價格漲幅來做觀察",
      "start": 129.46,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "今年黃金價格的漲幅",
      "start": 132.54,
      "duration": 1.86,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "整體來看是所有資產表現最為亮麗的",
      "start": 134.4,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "從年初到至今漲幅是51.9%",
      "start": 137.44,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "2024年它已經漲了2成6",
      "start": 140.44,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "2033年它也漲了13%",
      "start": 142.44,
      "duration": 1.9,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "2022年漲了0.5%",
      "start": 144.34,
      "duration": 1.6,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "即便2021年小跌也僅跌了3.8%左右",
