      "duration": 4.04,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "2019年和2020年分別漲了19%到24%",
      "start": 149.98,
      "duration": 3.3,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "所以基本上從美中貿易戰開始以後",
      "start": 153.28,
      "duration": 2.58,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "黃金價格就是一個高強度的牛市",
      "start": 155.86,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這也導致了今年整體股票市場",
      "start": 158.62,
      "duration": 2.58,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "遠遠落後給黃金資產",
      "start": 161.2,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "接近有20個百分點左右",
      "start": 163.5,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "在這樣的一個效果底下",
      "start": 165.3,
      "duration": 1.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "黃金資產的避險效果的推升",
      "start": 166.5,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "似乎讓大家有一股預期",
      "start": 168.9,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "認為股票資產也不是說",
      "start": 170.74,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "想像中泡沫來得這麼高",
      "start": 172.74,
      "duration": 1.66,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "因為市場上並不是一面性的",
      "start": 174.4,
      "duration": 1.78,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "把資產或資金投向",
      "start": 176.18,
      "duration": 1.92,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "風險性的股票資產當中",
      "start": 178.1,
      "duration": 2.18,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "而是把適度資金投向稍微具有保值",
      "start": 180.28,
      "duration": 3.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "以及避險資產的黃金",
      "start": 183.42,
      "duration": 1.76,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "也就是說現在所有資產的上漲",
      "start": 185.18,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "並非單一的市場樂觀",
      "start": 187.78,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "而是這種流動性預期的發酵",
      "start": 189.78,
      "duration": 2.1,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "也就是預估降息之後 放水之後",
      "start": 191.88,
      "duration": 3.02,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "對於全球資產價格的顯著推高",
      "start": 194.9,
      "duration": 2.32,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "如果我們仔細觀察",
      "start": 197.22,
      "duration": 1.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "張圖表是黃金ETF本身的實質持倉",
      "start": 198.36,
      "duration": 3.34,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "你會發現總體而言",
      "start": 201.7,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "總體持倉幅度甚至沒有超過19年的水準",
      "start": 203.5,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "但是黃金價格已經先被噴出了",
      "start": 206.5,
      "duration": 2.24,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這就代表著機構投資人",
      "start": 208.74,
      "duration": 2.06,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "以及央行的買盤",
      "start": 210.8,
      "duration": 1.08,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "對於黃金價格有非常顯著的作用",
      "start": 211.88,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "加上即便現在景氣的確有趨緩的現象",
      "start": 214.28,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "我們根據WTO所預估的整體貿易額",
      "start": 217.44,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "從24年到25年到26年",
      "start": 220.48,
      "duration": 2.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "預估會緩步的滑落",
      "start": 222.68,
      "duration": 1.5,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "而且總體經濟貿易",
      "start": 224.18,
      "duration": 1.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "以及經濟成長幅度",
      "start": 225.78,
      "duration": 1.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "預估在26年都有緩步下滑的空間",
      "start": 226.92,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "可是由於AI股占權值重大",
      "start": 229.36,
      "duration": 3.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "而AI的投資資本額並沒有因此而減少",
      "start": 232.5,
      "duration": 3.0,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "最後就導致了景氣雖然趨緩",
      "start": 235.5,
      "duration": 2.5,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "但是投資額以及股票市場",
      "start": 238.0,
      "duration": 2.04,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "驚驚漲的格局",
      "start": 240.04,
      "duration": 1.16,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "舉一個最直觀的例子來說",
      "start": 241.2,
      "duration": 1.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "我們看到從今年8月份以來",
      "start": 242.64,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "根據亞特蘭大GDPNoe模型的預估",
      "start": 244.64,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "從原本在三季度的預估季增幅",
      "start": 247.04,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "是接近2.5%",
      "start": 250.08,
      "duration": 1.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "一路來到3%",
      "start": 251.48,
      "duration": 1.34,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "到3.5%到3.8%到現在3.9%",
      "start": 252.82,
      "duration": 3.06,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "可是與此同時我們卻觀察到",
      "start": 255.88,
      "duration": 2.28,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "有進行資料中心設置的這些州",
      "start": 258.16,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "整體而言經濟仍然在擴張",
      "start": 261.72,
      "duration": 2.38,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "美國50個州當中我們看得很清楚",
      "start": 264.1,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "有22個州目前已經進入到深度衰退",
      "start": 266.4,
      "duration": 3.16,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "也就代表著GDP已經呈現負成長",
      "start": 269.56,
      "duration": 2.48,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "反而像德州 加州 維吉尼亞州",
      "start": 272.04,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "有進行大規模資料中心設置的這些州",
      "start": 275.6,
      "duration": 3.08,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "反而經濟仍然在顯著擴張",
      "start": 278.68,
      "duration": 1.96,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "而且成長的幅度遠遠大於其他州衰退的幅度",
      "start": 280.64,
      "duration": 3.34,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這也導致了在整個亞洲市場當中",
      "start": 283.98,
      "duration": 2.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "只要跟半導體股相關的整體績效",
      "start": 286.18,
      "duration": 2.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "表現都非常亮麗",
      "start": 288.72,
      "duration": 1.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "舉例來說在亞洲市場當中",
      "start": 290.02,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "基本上市值最大的就是台積電",
      "start": 291.82,
      "duration": 2.1,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "高達1.4兆美元",
      "start": 293.92,
      "duration": 1.74,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "其他後面幾名像騰訊 阿里巴巴 三星",
      "start": 295.66,
      "duration": 3.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "基本上都在持續的進行",
      "start": 298.96,
      "duration": 2.1,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "進一步的資本支出擴增",
      "start": 301.06,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這也導致市場上只要能夠傳出",
      "start": 303.0,
      "duration": 2.36,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "更多AI的好消息",
      "start": 305.36,
      "duration": 1.34,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "似乎就能夠蓋住中美之間",
      "start": 306.7,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "關稅戰所引發的負面消息",
      "start": 309.4,
      "duration": 2.18,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "像是我們看到AMD 輝達 甲骨文",
      "start": 311.58,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "CoreWeave基本上只要宣布",
      "start": 315.18,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "有一項重大協議敲定的時候",
      "start": 317.94,
      "duration": 1.88,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "當天價格就是直線噴出",
      "start": 319.82,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "後續拉回之後就在等待下一輪的噴出",
      "start": 321.82,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那這種AI的永動機",
      "start": 324.46,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "從輝達為圓心向外擴增",
      "start": 326.02,
      "duration": 2.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "搭配著OpenAI的實質需求",
      "start": 328.22,
      "duration": 2.08,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "最終就形成了誰能夠加入這條巨輪",
      "start": 330.3,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "誰轉得越快",
      "start": 333.66,
      "duration": 1.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那麼這項估值擴增的速度就會來得越高",
      "start": 334.7,
      "duration": 3.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "它會形成另外一種極端問題",
      "start": 337.74,
      "duration": 1.86,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "就是我們看到在SPY",
      "start": 339.6,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "跟非盈利的科技股股票的績效表現",
      "start": 341.44,
      "duration": 3.1,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "會形成巨大落差",
      "start": 344.54,
      "duration": 1.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "其實標普本身並沒有那種機器失控的問題",
      "start": 345.98,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "整體而言大概從今年4月份以來",
      "start": 349.22,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "標普也不過漲幅35.6%",
      "start": 351.92,
      "duration": 2.46,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "但是非盈利的科技股漲幅已經高達104.3%",
      "start": 354.38,
      "duration": 4.18,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "這也足以彰顯的",
      "start": 358.56,
      "duration": 1.36,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "市場上的確對於AI",
      "start": 359.92,
      "duration": 1.5,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "有非常高強度的估值想像空間",
      "start": 361.42,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "所以如果我們看到市場上",
      "start": 363.82,
      "duration": 1.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "它就形成新一種的輪動格局",
      "start": 365.36,
      "duration": 2.14,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "一種是高基期的不敢追",
      "start": 367.5,
      "duration": 2.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "可是低基期的又怕沒有輪動的空間",
      "start": 369.54,
      "duration": 2.5,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "畢竟可能跟AI股有一些脫節",
      "start": 372.04,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "最後就變成了統一做多科技股",
      "start": 374.04,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "可是亞洲貨幣受惠於升值的條件",
      "start": 376.74,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "加上也有不少的科技硬體股的支撐",
      "start": 379.34,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "市場轉向亞洲市場來做資金流入",
      "start": 381.78,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "舉例來說",
      "start": 384.38,
      "duration": 0.76,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "如果我們看在今年元月份到今年十月份",
      "start": 385.14,
      "duration": 3.28,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "表現最為亮麗的",
      "start": 388.42,
      "duration": 1.1,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "其實是MSCI新興市場的表現",
      "start": 389.52,
      "duration": 2.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "遠遠高過於全球指數和標普500指數",
      "start": 392.06,
      "duration": 2.66,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "不過從2011年以後",
      "start": 394.72,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "由於美國的單極體系的強大格局",
      "start": 396.66,
      "duration": 2.66,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "標普500指數整體漲幅是新興市場的5倍左右",
      "start": 399.32,
      "duration": 3.62,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "所以今年雖然新興市場漲很多",
      "start": 402.94,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "可是相對於過去十年比較起來看",
      "start": 405.34,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "其實也才剛剛開始上漲而已",
      "start": 407.64,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "這讓市場上有更多估值輪動的空間",
      "start": 409.64,
      "duration": 2.5,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "當然為什麼建議還是以ETF的方式",
      "start": 412.14,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "來參與行情可能更為適當",
      "start": 414.74,
      "duration": 1.84,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "原因在於我們看到在過去",
      "start": 416.58,
      "duration": 2.36,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "5年 10年 15年 20年當中",
      "start": 418.94,
      "duration": 2.84,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "表現最為亮麗的當然是輝達",
      "start": 421.78,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "從過去5年來看漲幅是2462%",
      "start": 423.78,
      "duration": 2.98,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "過去10年是27360%",
      "start": 426.76,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "過去15年是47035%",
      "start": 429.2,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "過去20年是92790%",
      "start": 431.8,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "可是輝達成為市場的萬眾矚目的焦點",
      "start": 434.2,
      "duration": 2.9,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "也不過是近5年的事情",
      "start": 437.1,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "事實上週期總會輪替",
      "start": 438.9,
      "duration": 1.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "搭配著科技型的ETF",
      "start": 440.7,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "順勢的搭配行情可能是一個更為聚焦的重點",
      "start": 442.7,
      "duration": 3.38,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那總而言之",
      "start": 446.08,
      "duration": 1.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "我們現在觀察到的實質跡象是",
      "start": 447.08,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "美國股市以及黃金資產價格的推高",
      "start": 449.08,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "成為今年的最強組合",
      "start": 451.52,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "但是2026年到底是否還是如此呢",
      "start": 453.08,
      "duration": 2.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "首先必須了解的是",
      "start": 455.62,
      "duration": 1.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "整個26年的資本支出的年增幅",
      "start": 457.02,
      "duration": 2.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "有很大的機率會比2025年還要來得低",
      "start": 459.32,
      "duration": 2.94,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "所以景氣仍然會有趨緩的跡象存在",
      "start": 462.26,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "但是有一個好的條件在於",
      "start": 464.86,
      "duration": 2.0,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "我們看到現在非科技產業",
      "start": 466.86,
      "duration": 2.24,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "非AI產業其實已經開始進行庫存回調了",
      "start": 469.1,
      "duration": 2.94,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "如果到26年27年",
      "start": 472.04,
      "duration": 1.9,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "整個AI的資本支出開始有年增遞緩的現象",
      "start": 473.94,
      "duration": 3.26,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "股價開始推不動的時候",
      "start": 477.2,
      "duration": 1.7,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "由其他股票其他公司剛好經歷了景氣低谷",
      "start": 478.9,
      "duration": 3.94,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "來後來追上也許可以沖銷掉",
      "start": 482.84,
      "duration": 2.18,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "到時候景氣的下行幅度",
      "start": 485.02,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "這是第一個觀察重點",
      "start": 486.58,
      "duration": 1.44,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "但是不會改變",
      "start": 488.02,
      "duration": 1.16,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "未來的生產力週期和資產價格的推升",
      "start": 489.18,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "仍然由科技股來主導的事實",
      "start": 491.98,
      "duration": 2.34,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "那第二種角度是",
      "start": 494.32,
      "duration": 1.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "整個黃金過往的週期慣性",
      "start": 495.52,
      "duration": 2.1,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "通常真正的主升段",
      "start": 497.62,
      "duration": 1.9,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "並不是在單純地緣政治緊張的同時",
      "start": 499.52,
      "duration": 2.64,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "通常真正的主升段",
      "start": 502.16,
      "duration": 1.54,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "來自於市場的降息大放水格局",
      "start": 503.7,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "而我們看到在近期",
      "start": 506.4,
      "duration": 1.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "隨著中東局勢的和穩",
      "start": 507.8,
      "duration": 1.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "事實上原油價格已經有非常顯著的破底情況",
      "start": 509.4,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "原油價格的下跌",
      "start": 512.6,
      "duration": 1.78,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "使得比今年價格",
      "start": 514.38,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "去年價格",
      "start": 515.94,
      "duration": 1.3,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "大前年價格都還要來得低",
      "start": 517.24,
      "duration": 1.94,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "更有進一步造成通膨趨緩的可能性",
      "start": 519.18,
      "duration": 3.2,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "在這樣的一個效果底下",
      "start": 522.38,
      "duration": 1.4,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "降息的水龍頭如果打開的話",
      "start": 523.78,
      "duration": 1.74,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "就能夠讓黃金價格有進一步的上升條件",
      "start": 525.52,
      "duration": 2.86,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "換句話說",
      "start": 528.38,
      "duration": 0.8,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "對於資產價格而言",
      "start": 529.18,
      "duration": 1.34,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "如果對於風險資產來看",
      "start": 530.52,
      "duration": 1.56,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "其實漲幅已經有了一大段",
      "start": 532.08,
      "duration": 1.78,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "可是呢",
      "start": 533.86,
      "duration": 0.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "對於整個景氣週期輪替來做思維的話",
      "start": 534.46,
      "duration": 2.7,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "如果一路的往上漲",
      "start": 537.16,
      "duration": 1.3,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "那難免就會有一點泡沫的疑慮",
      "start": 538.46,
      "duration": 1.74,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "適度的本益比下修才有介入的空間",
      "start": 540.2,
      "duration": 2.6,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "但是對於黃金資產價格來看",
      "start": 542.8,
      "duration": 2.04,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "過往的格局來看",
      "start": 544.84,
      "duration": 1.16,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "即便黃金價格真的已經漲很多了",
      "start": 546.0,
      "duration": 2.34,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "可是按照過往的現實情況",
      "start": 548.34,
      "duration": 2.26,
      "is_finance_related": false
    },
    {
      "text": "通常黃金價格漲幅的終點",
      "start": 550.6,
      "duration": 2.1,
      "is_finance_related": true
    },
    {
      "text": "都來自於降息週期的全面結束",
